Output agent.mp4
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 640
Set Height 1000
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 35ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='$ '; clear"
Enter
Type "touch .vhs-start; claude --mcp-config mcp.json --strict-mcp-config --permission-mode default --allowedTools 'mcp__trimscript__get_transcript mcp__trimscript__suggest_removal mcp__trimscript__list_edits mcp__trimscript__withdraw'"
Enter
Sleep 6s
Show
Sleep 1s
Type "In home-server-demo.mp4, suggest removing the side note about my cat and the sign-off. Don't apply anything."
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 55s
